Subject: mt7915: expose low-overhead Kite recovery trace counters

Keep recovery and offload diagnostics available after printk rotation. Counters are
updated at control, gate, stall, radio and reset transitions and are exposed through
debugfs without touching packet ownership or issuing mailbox commands.

